{"id":"salida","lemma":"salida","pos":"noun","rank":804,"glosses":["exit, way out","departure","future, future opportunity"],"ipa":"/saˈlida/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"salidas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/82/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-salida.wav","examples":[{"text":"Estoy registrando mi salida.","en":"I'm checking out.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501411"},{"text":"El edificio tiene salidas por todos lados.","en":"The building has exits on all sides."},{"text":"Le mostraré la salida.","en":"I'll walk you out.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523387"},{"text":"Todos en el edificio se dirigieron a las salidas al mismo tiempo.","en":"Everybody in the building headed for the exits at the same time."},{"text":"Es un callejón sin salida.","en":"It's a dead end.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441840"}]}